i need to formalize this process, but here is what i've got

1. Do your gis work, get your extent and your subbasins into a single shapefile.
2. Run setup_new_area/area_setup.R. 
    Adjust the config block before running, no need to reproject shapefile from Step 1. Script will do it.
    This will create the three assets you need for your S3 config folder. 1) cells.gpkg 
    2). <area_id>-area-vol-calc-masks.parquet and 3). <area_id>-boundary-mask.parquet.
3. Add_area_aws/upload_step8_aws.R
4. Create a new manifest then
5. Add_area_aws/upload_manifest.R
    - at this point your pipeline should run.
    - after it does, proceed to backfill operations
6. backfill_aoi_cum_precip_rework.R
7. upload_archive_s3.R
